            <div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
                <p n="1-7">
                    Here lies buried the honourable Reijnier van Buyten Dick van Dort,
                    who was in his life 
                    ...
                    and accountant <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>boehhouder</foreign><note>That is, <foreign>boekhouder</foreign>.</note></supplied> of the garnison in the city of Nagapatnam,
                    who died here
                    on 2 May of the year 1684, approximately 64 years old.                   
                </p>       
